# Evaluating Electronic Texts in the Humanities.

**Authors:** Hockey, Susan

## Abstract
Discussion of the growth of electronic texts in the humanities focuses on issues that libraries should consider regarding collection development policies for electronic texts. Existing texts and applications are described; markup, or encoding schemes, are explained; cataloging is discussed; and software issues are considered. (Contains 27 references.) (LRW)

